{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"H2、H7支持仍无把握且部分感受无法完全共享，M16明确说明先前的不安使此刻的亲近更可贵、感情更难收住，因此想让对方知道自己有多高兴，是对已有情感难以抑制的具体化，并未另加前史或原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"H2、H7支持心意尚无答案且部分感受只能独自承受，M27及原第4条支持情感更直接、难以隐藏，M46及原第5条支持激动退下后更清楚地感到不舍，因此各项因果均有依据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"越界\",\n      \"why\": \"H2、H6、H8及M25只支持时间流逝带来的不安、关系尚无把握以及亲近本身带有风险，并未支持越用力抓紧就越摇晃、船舱越不稳这一新增因果，也未明确提出额外的暴露判断。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 4,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"H6明确支持越在乎这段时间就越能感觉到时间流逝，H8、H9支持对快乐消逝的焦虑及由舍不得引发的急切兴奋，M33也明确说明亲近正在成为过去使他不愿离开，因此提前生出留恋的因果链有充分依据。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f1083821-b171-4864-b9aa-61a664f9fe7e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T132930761347Z", "elapsed_seconds": 244.782, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:33:35.544941+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "eb53bd993b32bd99d62ac7827a0ed9996acdb0fe1aab68f3b39e55449ff061f1", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment